    "title": "2026-07-24周报",
    "range": "07.20 — 07.24",
    "body": "\n    <div class=\"hd-row\">\n      <div class=\"hd\">\n        <div class=\"hd-l\">\n          <h2>信投 AI 2.0 项目建设 · 项目周报</h2>\n          <p>上海信投 · AI 能力建设专项 · 周报</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hd-r\">\n          <div class=\"rk\">填报周期</div>\n          <input class=\"rv\" type=\"text\" value=\"07.20 — 07.24\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sec\" data-node=\"overview\">\n      <div class=\"sec-h\"><h3>本周概览</h3><span class=\"line\"></span><span class=\"count\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"kpis\"><div class=\"kpi\" style=\"background:#EFF6FF;color:#2563EB;\">\n    <div class=\"n\">01 · 底座</div>\n    <div class=\"t\" contenteditable=\"true\">算力与模型基础底座建设</div>\n    <div class=\"pb\"><div class=\"pf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 70%; background: rgb(37, 99, 235);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pv\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <input class=\"pct\" data-pct=\"\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">%\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"kpi\" style=\"background:#F0FDFA;color:#0D9488;\">\n    <div class=\"n\">02 · 数据</div>\n    <div class=\"t\" contenteditable=\"true\">数据治理与知识库构建</div>\n    <div class=\"pb\"><div class=\"pf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 50%; background: rgb(13, 148, 136);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pv\">\n      <select class=\"st sy\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\" selected=\"selected\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <input class=\"pct\" data-pct=\"\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" style=\"color:#0D9488;\">%\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"kpi\" style=\"background:#F5F3FF;color:#7C3AED;\">\n    <div class=\"n\">03 · 智能体</div>\n    <div class=\"t\" contenteditable=\"true\">企业智能体平台建设</div>\n    <div class=\"pb\"><div class=\"pf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 30%; background: rgb(124, 58, 237);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pv\">\n      <select class=\"st sy\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\" selected=\"selected\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <input class=\"pct\" data-pct=\"\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"30\" style=\"color:#7C3AED;\">%\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"kpi\" style=\"background:#FFF7ED;color:#E85D1C;\">\n    <div class=\"n\">04 · 应用</div>\n    <div class=\"t\" contenteditable=\"true\">运营管理系统升级与智能应用建设</div>\n    <div class=\"pb\"><div class=\"pf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 80%; background: rgb(232, 93, 28);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pv\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <input class=\"pct\" data-pct=\"\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"80\" style=\"color:#E85D1C;\">%\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"kpi\" style=\"background:#FFFBEB;color:#D97706;\">\n    <div class=\"n\">05 · 需求</div>\n    <div class=\"t\" contenteditable=\"true\">用户需求及技术方案</div>\n    <div class=\"pb\"><div class=\"pf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 80%; background: rgb(217, 119, 6);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pv\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <input class=\"pct\" data-pct=\"\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"80\" style=\"color:#D97706;\">%\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"kpi\" style=\"background:#FFF1F2;color:#E11D48;\">\n    <div class=\"n\">06 · 协调</div>\n    <div class=\"t\" contenteditable=\"true\">其他组织协调工作</div>\n    <div class=\"pb\"><div class=\"pf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; background: rgb(225, 29, 72);\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pv\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <input class=\"pct\" data-pct=\"\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" style=\"color:#E11D48;\">%\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sec\" data-node=\"progress\">\n      <div class=\"sec-h\"><h3>本周进展</h3><span class=\"line\"></span><span class=\"count\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"row\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #2563EB;\">\n    <div class=\"ri\">\n      <div class=\"idx\" style=\"color:#2563EB;\">01 · 底座</div>\n      <div class=\"ti\" contenteditable=\"true\">算力与模型基础底座建设</div>\n      <div class=\"ow\">负责人：<input type=\"text\" value=\"数字智能事业部\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"bf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 70%; background: rgb(37, 99, 235);\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rb\">\n      <ul>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>L20服务器&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">07-21周二，智科已部署数字人模型（vllm-openai:v0.25.1+ qwen36-27b）；</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(148, 163, 184); font-size: 12px;\">07-23周四，库帕思进场安装语料清洗产线</span><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>H200服务器</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;07-20周一，智科已向信管网科发起授权采购邮件，网科走内部采购流程中</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>通用算力</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">07-21周二服务器到货，周三完成上架通电(含4090D服务器供电切换)，预计周五可可完成基础环境安装及网络配置</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <div class=\"pp\"><span data-pct=\"\">70</span><small>%</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"row\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #0D9488;\">\n    <div class=\"ri\">\n      <div class=\"idx\" style=\"color:#0D9488;\">02 · 数据</div>\n      <div class=\"ti\" contenteditable=\"true\">数据治理与知识库构建</div>\n      <div class=\"ow\">负责人：<input type=\"text\" value=\"数字智能事业部\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"bf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 50%; background: rgb(13, 148, 136);\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rb\">\n      <ul>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>历史档案采集</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(148, 163, 184); font-size: 12px;\">07-22周三，开始历史档案文件上传到minio文件服务器</span><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n        \n        \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>OCR解析</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">库帕思启动历史档案OCR识别及质检待工作(预计周五或下周一启动)</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li><li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>知识库部署</b> <font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">智联文书知识库环境</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(148, 163, 184); font-size: 12px;\">部署准本中</span><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li></ul>\n      <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <select class=\"st sy\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\" selected=\"selected\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <div class=\"pp\"><span data-pct=\"\">50</span><small>%</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"row\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #7C3AED;\">\n    <div class=\"ri\">\n      <div class=\"idx\" style=\"color:#7C3AED;\">03 · 智能体</div>\n      <div class=\"ti\" contenteditable=\"true\">企业智能体平台建设</div>\n      <div class=\"ow\">负责人：<input type=\"text\" value=\"研发中心\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"bf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 30%; background: rgb(124, 58, 237);\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rb\">\n      <ul>\n        \n        \n        \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>需求调研</b>&nbsp;<i>07-21周二，</i><font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">研发中心参加战投部和投资部需求调研，初步框定MVP范围</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li><li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>原型开发</b>&nbsp;<i>进行中，</i><span style=\"color: rgb(148, 163, 184); font-size: 12px; margin-left: 6px;\">初步计划周五下午或下周初进行原型演示</span><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li><li contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">方案设计</span>&nbsp;<i>进行中</i><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li></ul>\n      <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <select class=\"st sy\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\" selected=\"selected\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <div class=\"pp\"><span data-pct=\"\">30</span><small>%</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"row\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #E85D1C;\">\n    <div class=\"ri\">\n      <div class=\"idx\" style=\"color:#E85D1C;\">04 · 应用</div>\n      <div class=\"ti\" contenteditable=\"true\">运营管理系统升级与智能应用建设</div>\n      <div class=\"ow\">负责人：<input type=\"text\" value=\"数字智能事业部\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"bf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 80%; background: rgb(232, 93, 28);\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rb\">\n      <ul>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>运营管理系统升级</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">数据看板-预算财务指标完成情况数据下钻功能及投后管理文档在线浏览功能开发，计划07-24周五发版。</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>AI生成财务报告&nbsp;</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">在PPT报告模版维护页面增加AI对话功能开发，计划(7月底发版)。</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n        \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>AI赋能接口封装</b>&nbsp;<i>配合数字人进行接口及RAG改造中，计划</i><span style=\"color: rgb(148, 163, 184); font-size: 12px;\">(7月底发版)</span><font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">。</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li></ul>\n      <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <div class=\"pp\"><span data-pct=\"\">80</span><small>%</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"row\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #D97706;\">\n    <div class=\"ri\">\n      <div class=\"idx\" style=\"color:#D97706;\">05 · 需求</div>\n      <div class=\"ti\" contenteditable=\"true\">用户需求及技术方案</div>\n      <div class=\"ow\">负责人：<input type=\"text\" value=\"智科团队\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"bf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 80%; background: rgb(217, 119, 6);\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rb\">\n      <ul>\n        \n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>知识库</b>&nbsp;<i>根据前几轮的沟通内容，完成知识库的初步层级架构设计</i><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n        \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\"><b>计财部</b>&nbsp;<font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">为本部定制了Excel采集表，实现“当月发生值”向系统“累计值”的自动换算，解决了重复填报问题。</span></font><span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li></ul>\n      <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <div class=\"pp\"><span data-pct=\"\">80</span><small>%</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div><div class=\"row\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #E11D48;\">\n    <div class=\"ri\">\n      <div class=\"idx\" style=\"color:#E11D48;\">06 · 协调</div>\n      <div class=\"ti\" contenteditable=\"true\">其他组织协调工作</div>\n      <div class=\"ow\">负责人：<input type=\"text\" value=\"现场项目组\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"bf\" data-bar=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; background: rgb(225, 29, 72);\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rb\">\n      <ul>\n        <li contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">外采知识库对接&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#94a3b8\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">07-20周一，获取投研派的数据清单，周二和两个业务部门详细讨论了万得和投研派的数据清单，已将沟通结果同步给万得和投研派，待对方反馈。（一级市场信息：①一级市场的行业概括、②行业报告、③可比公司、④行研报告、⑤产业链图谱、⑥财务、⑦估值指标等）</span></font></li>\n        \n        \n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <select class=\"st sg\" data-status=\"\"><option value=\"正常\" selected=\"selected\">正常</option><option value=\"关注\">关注</option><option value=\"风险\">风险</option></select>\n      <div class=\"pp\"><span data-pct=\"\">100</span><small>%</small></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sec\" data-node=\"plan\">\n      <div class=\"sec-h\"><h3>下周计划</h3><span class=\"line\"></span><span class=\"count\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"nw\"><div class=\"nc\" style=\"background:#EFF6FF;border-color:#2563EB20;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color:#2563EB;--mc:#2563EB;\"><span class=\"nc-title\">01 算力与模型基础底座建设</span><span class=\"tag-toggle\" data-action=\"toggle-key\">重点</span></h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">1.0&nbsp; 应用服务器环境部署<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">L20 服务器部署数字人模型<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n  </div><div class=\"nc\" style=\"background:#F0FDFA;border-color:#0D948820;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color:#0D9488;--mc:#0D9488;\"><span class=\"nc-title\">02 数据治理与知识库构建</span><span class=\"tag-toggle on\" data-action=\"toggle-key\">重点</span></h4>\n    <ul>\n      \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">历史档案OCR识别及质检<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">智联文书知识库环境部署<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n  </div><div class=\"nc\" style=\"background:#F5F3FF;border-color:#7C3AED20;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color:#7C3AED;--mc:#7C3AED;\"><span class=\"nc-title\">03 企业智能体平台建设</span><span class=\"tag-toggle on\" data-action=\"toggle-key\">重点</span></h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">原型演示及提交MVP范围清单<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">细化技术方案设计<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      \n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n  </div><div class=\"nc\" style=\"background:#FFF7ED;border-color:#E85D1C20;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color:#E85D1C;--mc:#E85D1C;\"><span class=\"nc-title\">04 运营管理系统升级与智能应用建设</span><span class=\"tag-toggle\" data-action=\"toggle-key\">重点</span></h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">继续完善AI生成财务分析报告；企业统计看板 6个指标数据的明细下钻及投后管理增加经营工作总结及计划<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">AI数字人前后端环境部署及本地化修改<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      \n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n  </div><div class=\"nc\" style=\"background:#FFFBEB;border-color:#D9770620;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color:#D97706;--mc:#D97706;\"><span class=\"nc-title\">05 用户需求及技术方案</span><span class=\"tag-toggle\" data-action=\"toggle-key\">重点</span></h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">完善投后管理报告需求分析与设计；跟进本部已填报数据，逐条确认期初值及特殊统计口径，以保障数据100%准确。<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">1.0通算服务器、L20服务器、4090D服务器的应用部署架构<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n  </div><div class=\"nc\" style=\"background:#FFF1F2;border-color:#E11D4820;\">\n    <h4 style=\"color:#E11D48;--mc:#E11D48;\"><span class=\"nc-title\">06 其他组织协调工作</span><span class=\"tag-toggle\" data-action=\"toggle-key\">重点</span></h4>\n    <ul>\n      \n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">历史档案OCR解析<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n      <li contenteditable=\"true\">第三方知识库厂商对接工作<span class=\"del-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-action=\"del-item\">×</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <button class=\"add-row\" data-action=\"add-item\">+ 新增事项</button>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sec\" data-node=\"risk\">\n      <div class=\"sec-h\"><h3>风险与应对</h3><span class=\"line\"></span><span class=\"count\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"risk-table\"><div class=\"risk-head\"